  "description": {
   "en": "The beautiful, smart and elegant Wendy, lives in an orphanage in the slums of London. One day, she is taken in by her wealthy uncle, Lord Silence. However, the land where his old castle is a place where ancient religious rituals are deeply rooted to this day, and where it is believed that demons, fairies and giants still exist... Will Wendy find out more about her parents who abandoned her in this old castle she is taken to?\n\nAlso contains Hashire Alice, Kieta Houseki and Stella Vista."
